  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Right, I'll be quick, because I've got a conference call at half ten. It's the bloating again, after I've had dairy.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:00",
      "end_timestamp": "00:11",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Then let's go straight to it. Tell me what happens after dairy.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:13",
      "end_timestamp": "00:20",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Within an hour, my stomach swells up like a balloon. Cheese, milk in my tea, ice cream, any of it. And then the wind.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:23",
      "end_timestamp": "00:37",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "How long does the wind and bloating last?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:40",
      "end_timestamp": "00:45",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "A few hours. Sometimes till the next morning.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:47",
      "end_timestamp": "00:51",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Last time we talked about the irritable bowel and the tablets. How have they been?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:54",
      "end_timestamp": "01:03",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The mebeverine, 135 mg three times a day, maybe, I might have that wrong, it's on the packet. And the peppermint capsules, with meals.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:05",
      "end_timestamp": "01:19",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So, 135 mg, you think, and the peppermint capsules. Are they helping at all?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:20",
      "end_timestamp": "01:27",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
